// village_economy noncombat acceptance: Lift A travel verb. Caster
// walks to the workshop tile (5, 5) over 5s = 50 ticks. The
// chronicle record (kind=70) lands once per cast; the per-fixture
// consumer rule in `village_economy.sim` drains it and bumps the
// agent's per-agent travel-completed counter (re-purposed
// `disguise_expires_at_tick` SoA cell) so the runtime test can pin
// "at least one travel landed".
//
// `travel_to <x> <y> for <duration>` lowers via the `travel_to` arm of
// `dsl_compiler::ability_lower::lower_effect_stmt` to `EffectOp::TravelTo
// { dest_x_q8, dest_y_q8, eta_ticks }`. The destination is q8-packed
// into payload_a; eta_ticks lands in payload_b.

ability WalkToWorkshop {
    target: self
    cooldown: 10s
    hint: utility

    travel_to 5 5 for 5s [UTILITY: 100]
}
